ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¿Habías oído alguna vez eso de
que, para conocer bien a alguien,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
tienes que haber visto dónde vive?
{{TAG:0003:0021:}}Bueno, pues si no lo habías oído,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
ya lo he dicho yo.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Entonces, ¿qué dices, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¿Quieres venir a ver mi casa?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¿{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
¡Me encantaría!
Ya te conozco bastante

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Tu sais,{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} si ça t'intéresse,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} tu peux
venir chez moi !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Si t'as pas peur d'y voir un truc
beaucoup trop cool pour toi...{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}HA HA HA !{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
OK, allons-y !
Merci, mais non.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Bak,{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} ilgini çekiyorsa,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} evime gelebilirsin!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Heh. Bu kadar şahane bir dekorasyonu
görmeye korktun mu?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0002:}}GAHAHA!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Olur, gelirim!
Sağ ol ama... hayır.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}When you see other people's homes,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
sometimes you just get some really
great decorating ideas, am I right?!
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}So what do you say, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}You're welcome to come over and
hang out if you want to!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Sure, I'm in!
I'm gonna pass.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Başkasının evini görünce,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} bazen insanın aklına
harika dekorasyon fikirleri gelir, değil mi?!
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ee ne dersin, {{TAG:0005:0000:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}İstersen evime gelip takılabilirsin!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Olur, varım!
Ben pas geçeyim.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Senti, {{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} se non hai niente
da fare,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} perché non vieni a trovarmi
a casa mia? Tipo, adesso?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Voglio farti vedere quanto stile ho!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
OK, ci sto!
Ora non posso.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Aklıma harika bir fikir geldi!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}Neden hemen şimdi
evime gidip takılmıyoruz?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}İstersen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
evimin düzeninden
kendi evin için birkaç fikir bile
kapabilirsin!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ne dersin?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Hadi şimdi gidelim!{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Tamam, gidelim!
Hayır, şimdi olmaz.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}It seems like you're kinda curious
about me, aren't you?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}All right!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} I'll let you experience
my world as much as you want!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Feel like hanging out at my place?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Yes, I do!
Not right now...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Beni biraz merak ediyorsun galiba, ha?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Pekâlâ!{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Dünyamı istediğin kadar deneyimlemene izin
vereceğim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Evimde takılmak ister misin?{{TAG:000F:0005:00000000}}
Evet!
Şimdi olmaz...
